WEBVTT

00:12:58.356 --> 00:13:01.916
don't underestimate
how technology changes markets

00:13:01.956 --> 00:13:04.596
and how fast these changes can happen

00:13:04.636 --> 00:13:06.756
and how you can incentivize them

00:13:06.796 --> 00:13:09.916
by using the right kind of policies.

00:13:10.796 --> 00:13:14.476
Well, we still have a way to go.

00:13:14.516 --> 00:13:17.356
Our latest climate budget analysis

00:13:17.356 --> 00:13:20.556
shows that we are up
for reaching a reduction

00:13:20.556 --> 00:13:26.116
with the adaptable measures
by 62 percent by 2030.

00:13:26.156 --> 00:13:27.636
So we are doing well,

00:13:27.676 --> 00:13:31.996
but we have to do more,
and we need to develop,